{
  "name": "Sword Shield",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to fight with your Spiritual Weapon like a seamless unit, using it to attack as well as defend.</p><p>When a creature you can see hits you with an Attack Roll while your Spiritual Weapon is within 5 ft of you, you can use your Reaction to gain a +5 bonus to AC against that attack, potentially causing it to miss you.</p><p>If the attack misses, you can make one weapon attack or melee spell attack with your Spiritual Weapon against the attacker as part of this Reaction.</p>",
